target loom, resume
 1 restore: restore snapshot latest into scratch volumes beside the app
 2 sqlite: run an integrity check on every SQLite database in the scratch volumes
 3 database: start a scratch database and load the dump
 4 objects: start a scratch object store on the restored files
 5 app: start the app's long-running workloads on the restored data and wait for them
 6 cleanup: remove the scratch volumes, database and containers, and record the drill
